  "body": "Smart. Stylish. Close to everything.\r\n\r\nLight-filled and beautifully finished, this contemporary 3 bedroom apartment puts the best of Mairangi Bay right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\n• Open-plan living + sunny balcony\r\n\r\n• Gaggenau kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Smart home technology\r\n\r\n• 2 Daikin heat pumps\r\n\r\n• Secure garage car park\r\n\r\n• Reasonable body corporate fees\r\n\r\nWalk to the beach, cafés, restaurants, village and coastal tracks - then lock up and leave whenever adventure calls.\r\n\r\nLess maintenance. More lifestyle. Mairangi Bay at its best.",
